Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Source: OCR of hardcoded English subs ([1056 Filler] End of Wano 03.5 - Farewell.mp4); opening lyrics omitted}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.46,0:01:30.04,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Edited by fedew\NSubtitles by HatSubs
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.96,0:01:38.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Winding our story's clock back\Njust a little bit...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.09,0:01:42.60,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1676,236)}Oden\NCastle\NRuins\NKuri
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.68,0:01:44.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here we find what once was the final resting place of\NKozuki Oden and his retainers, including Kin'emon:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.22,0:01:46.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The ruins of Oden Castle, in Kuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.62,0:02:09.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido's Blast Breath left nothing\Nof the ruins in its wake.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.79,0:02:16.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was there that Oden constructed\Nhis first castle upon becoming Daimyo of Kuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.38,0:02:17.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Daimyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.17,0:02:18.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Daimyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.43,0:02:20.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Daimyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.89,0:02:24.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.43,0:02:27.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey there!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.31,0:02:29.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffytaro-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.02,0:02:32.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yo! What's got the\Nwhole gang comin' here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.23,0:02:35.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have come to tell\NOden-sama of our victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.36,0:02:38.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There are other matters we want\Nto discuss with him as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.95,0:02:41.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why's you gara here, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.66,0:02:43.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm here to see Oden!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.29,0:02:54.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am certain Oden-sama is overjoyed\Nto meet with the Savior of Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.13,0:02:55.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ya really think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.01,0:02:59.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden-sama...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.51,0:03:04.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It is thanks to Luffytaro-dono and the others here\Nthat we were able to fell Orochi and Kaido,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.05,0:03:06.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and return the Land of Wano\Nto her people.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.78,0:03:22.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We, together with our new Shogun,\NMomonosuke-sama,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.95,0:03:27.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,swear to you that we shall restore\Nour country to what it once was,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.58,0:03:29.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,a place where all can live in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.42,0:03:37.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How I wish Ashura and Izo\Ncould join us here...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.14,0:03:52.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.23,0:03:57.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Within our bosoms,\Nalongside Oden-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.73,0:04:00.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mmm, true that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.11,0:04:04.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Certainly they must be hosting\Na grand feast in the afterlife!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.07,0:04:05.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Primeow meowmeow!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.95,0:04:10.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden cooked by Oden-sama\Nwas the most delicious thing in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.96,0:04:16.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes... I do recall its taste,\Nand how we all used to share in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.67,0:04:21.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aye. It tasted even better\Nafter training with Oden-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.38,0:04:24.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sounds neat!\NWish I coulda had some!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.80,0:04:26.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.43,0:04:29.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's ask Sanji-kun\Nto cook it for us sometime!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.68,0:04:33.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We ought to stock up on\Ningredients for it then!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.77,0:04:37.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Totally! We're gonna buy tons!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.81,0:04:39.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy-dono...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.28,0:04:41.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you departing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.94,0:04:43.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.36,0:04:48.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We would like to take this opportunity
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.62,0:04:52.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...to once again offer\Nour most sincere gratitude!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.12,0:04:53.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoooa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.04,0:04:59.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,C'mon, cut that out!\NWe're friends, ain't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.38,0:05:03.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.72,0:05:07.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Carrot!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.89,0:05:11.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're leaving already?\NYou can't, you can't, you just can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.93,0:05:18.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna say goodbye to Nami, either!\NDun wanna, dun wanna, I dun wanna!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.35,0:05:19.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Carrot...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.48,0:05:21.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's botherin' ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.82,0:05:23.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're going back home...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.53,0:05:25.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...to the Mokomo Dukedom!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.61,0:05:29.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be defending our home\Nalong with Wanda and everyone else!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.62,0:05:35.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Miyagi, Tristan...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.75,0:05:37.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you both!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.37,0:05:42.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you for all\Nyou've taught me about medicine!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.84,0:05:45.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dr. Chopper, take care of yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.59,0:05:48.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I do recall, Carrot-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.72,0:05:54.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you stowed away aboard the Sunny\Nbecause you wanted to see the sea, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.14,0:05:55.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, how'd you like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.56,0:05:57.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was only the best adventure ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.52,0:06:01.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I got to see islands I never knew existed,\Nand met some nice people!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.65,0:06:07.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There were lotsa scary moments,\Nbut I feel I'm a little stronger than I used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.20,0:06:09.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's why the adventure\NI had with you all...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.95,0:06:15.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...is something I'll treasure\Nfor the rest of my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.75,0:06:19.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lemme have one last garchu\Nfor the road!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.58,0:06:21.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Garchu!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.17,0:06:25.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was super fun chatting and having a blast\Nwith you in the women's quarters, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.34,0:06:27.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it was the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.72,0:06:29.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You too, Chobro!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.88,0:06:31.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That tickles!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.47,0:06:33.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm happy too, Carrot!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.68,0:06:35.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Garchu!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.85,0:06:37.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Garchu!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.23,0:06:41.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah! I saw Zoro on my way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.69,0:06:42.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro, ya say?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.81,0:07:25.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go on, it's on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.45,0:07:40.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whatcha doin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.41,0:07:42.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thought I'd share a round with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.42,0:07:46.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll pour it for ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.79,0:07:50.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You the one that left the flowers?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.09,0:07:50.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eh? Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.59,0:07:54.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Big Sis helped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.80,0:08:00.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, here you are, Zorojuro-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.22,0:08:01.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.87,0:08:27.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,May you both rest in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.34,0:08:33.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Once they finish that big, nice temple,\NI'll come to see you every day, Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.38,0:08:36.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That way, you won't be lonely, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.05,0:08:37.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.48,0:08:52.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your being here means the time has come\Nfor you to depart, does it not?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.24,0:08:53.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.49,0:08:56.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It shall be lonely without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.08,0:09:07.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I shall have to bid farewell\Nto my father's beloved Enma, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.42,0:09:10.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.18,0:09:18.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I ain't givin' it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.51,0:09:21.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aye, of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.68,0:09:25.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Enma, able to rend even\Nthe deepest depths of hell", huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.77,0:09:30.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden must've been\None helluva guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.02,0:09:35.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Cause he'd completely\Ntamed this thing, hadn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.07,0:09:41.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yet you, Zorojuro-san,\Nliberated our nation...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.37,0:09:44.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...through your\Nskillful wielding of Enma.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.00,0:09:46.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nah, not skilled enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.46,0:09:51.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To me, it looks as if Enma is rejoicing...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.63,0:09:53.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...at having found its new master.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.22,0:10:01.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I... will become stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.89,0:10:10.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey, hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.81,0:10:14.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The hell's this, Fraguy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.53,0:10:18.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yo, boss! Somethin' outta place?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.03,0:10:19.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn right, there is!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.99,0:10:23.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huuuh?! Ain't no way there is!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.12,0:10:24.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.04,0:10:29.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ya asked me to check out\Nwhere ya made repairs,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.54,0:10:33.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and I was doin' just that, numbskull!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.00,0:10:38.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's perfection,\Nya ingrate!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.26,0:10:43.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You coulda left me\Nat least one spot t'fix,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.35,0:10:45.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ya absolute buffoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.64,0:10:48.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, excuse me for lettin' ya down!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.27,0:10:50.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So she's all repaired\Nand in tip top shape?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.60,0:10:53.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's definitely the\NStraw Hats' shipwright!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.98,0:10:57.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Later, ya total dunce!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.49,0:11:01.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And stay healthy,\Nya blitherin' idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.41,0:11:03.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What're ya yappin' about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.16,0:11:06.16,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1687,275)}Flower\NCapital
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.66,0:11:08.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heeey, done yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.83,0:11:12.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir! Yes, yes!\NI'm on my way, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.71,0:11:14.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right, sorry to have kept you waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.96,0:11:15.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No prob.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.25,0:11:18.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How do you feel about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.46,0:11:18.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.92,0:11:20.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think it's a great fit for you, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.01,0:11:22.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usohachi-san, you're cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.89,0:11:25.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's the most handsome\Nman in all of Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.18,0:11:27.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.47,0:11:30.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Need something from me, m'lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.60,0:11:33.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I love it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.35,0:11:35.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa, uh, I mean,\Nnot really...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.06,0:11:39.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, say no more!\NI hear you, I hear you...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.28,0:11:41.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This color would look good on you, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.40,0:11:41.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.99,0:11:43.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usohachi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.70,0:11:45.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey there, ladykiller!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.12,0:11:47.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The color red was just made for him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.95,0:11:50.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's sooo hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.50,0:11:53.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't go fallin' in love\Nwith me, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.92,0:11:55.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, absolutely not!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.63,0:11:56.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heeh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.38,0:11:59.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All I'm after is plain black cloth!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.34,0:12:01.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And a crapload of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.34,0:12:05.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Black cloth?\NFor what might you need so much, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.89,0:12:08.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh? Well, uh, that's, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.39,0:12:09.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't tell anyone, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.14,0:12:15.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whaaaa!! For that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.94,0:12:19.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I shall provide you with\Nthe finest available!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.11,0:12:21.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right on!\NCountin' on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.95,0:12:31.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.04,0:12:33.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's it for today!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.29,0:12:37.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.08,0:12:40.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sangoro's Specialty Soba!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.92,0:12:42.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.09,0:12:44.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I love your Specialty Soba!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.30,0:12:45.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.14,0:12:46.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come again!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.64,0:12:48.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How's it taste?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.97,0:12:50.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It is the best I've ever had!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.51,0:12:51.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.56,0:12:54.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, Chuji!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.85,0:12:58.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How're ya doin', little guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.32,0:13:01.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Coochie coochie...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.57,0:13:06.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.86,0:13:08.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh... Oh, nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.78,0:13:10.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.08,0:13:15.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have yet to properly express my thanks\Nto you for saving me at Onigashima.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.83,0:13:19.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't mention it!\NJust doing the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.51,0:13:26.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, will you be coming back here again?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.01,0:13:34.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Because eating your soba, Sangoro-san, gives me\Nthe strength to keep working hard, day after day!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.64,0:13:37.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm happy just hearing that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.52,0:13:39.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I've gotta set off soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.65,0:13:42.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sangoro-san, I...!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.90,0:13:44.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mr. Soba Chef?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.57,0:13:47.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Badumbadumbadum!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.45,0:13:49.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Could I trouble you for a bowl?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.24,0:13:53.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin-chwan!\NThanks for comin' bwy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.45,0:13:55.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd like mine served hot, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.29,0:13:58.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm on it, Robin chwan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.37,0:14:01.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, if I might have the same?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.59,0:14:02.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.34,0:14:07.84,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1642,299)}Okobore\NTown
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.34,0:14:07.84,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1641,452)}Kuri
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.06,0:14:14.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Great job, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.85,0:14:18.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go on, rest awhile\Nand have some oshiruko!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.81,0:14:21.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Always appreciate\Nthe refreshments, O-Tsuru-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.77,0:14:23.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's dig in!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.99,0:14:28.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks good!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.53,0:14:31.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's oshiruko!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.03,0:14:33.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry to have kept you waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.66,0:14:35.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dun worry 'bout it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.20,0:14:36.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Down the hatch!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.96,0:14:39.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yuu-yu-um!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.96,0:14:47.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nom, nom!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.22,0:14:58.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the food!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.19,0:15:10.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O-Tsuru-san's oshiruko is the bestest!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.11,0:15:14.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ya think so?\NEat the mochi, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.07,0:15:15.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.63,0:15:24.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It'sh sho guud!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.79,0:15:27.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eat 'til ya burst, Tama!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.31,0:15:37.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's up, Tama?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.31,0:15:42.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When I think about havin'\Nto say goodbye to you here,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.77,0:15:45.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I get a lump in my throat...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.40,0:15:49.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,First Ace,\Nan' now you, Big Bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.36,0:15:55.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All the people\NI love leave me...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.78,0:15:57.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tama...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.66,0:16:03.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You know that time ya gave me\Nthat precious rice of yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.88,0:16:07.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I ain't ever gonna forget that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.06,0:16:23.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then I ain't gonna forget 'bout\Nyou or yer crew, Big Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.60,0:16:24.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.90,0:16:26.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kay, gotta get goin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.48,0:16:27.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okey dokey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.86,0:16:30.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll meet again, Tama!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.46,0:16:53.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Big Bro, thank yoooou!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.18,0:16:59.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'mma be like you 'n Ace...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.18,0:17:02.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...an' get stronger, you'll see!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.52,0:17:15.03,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1668,273)}Tokage\NPort\NUdon
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.94,0:17:14.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And now, our story\Nreturns to the present...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.65,0:17:19.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy! We're ready to set sail!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.83,0:17:21.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.12,0:17:24.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But are you really sure\Nabout leaving like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.41,0:17:29.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We didn't say goodbye\Nto Momo-chan and Kin'emon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.21,0:17:31.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.25,0:17:34.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We don't gotta go that far.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.17,0:17:36.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pretty cold, comin' outta you, Mossbrain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.34,0:17:38.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut it, Swirlybrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.72,0:17:48.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But of all the people in Wano,\Nthey shared in our adventures the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.06,0:17:51.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quite, it seems a bit sad\Nto part ways like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.07,0:17:59.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy, what do you wanna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.87,0:18:08.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It'll be fine.\NHe'll come!
